
A collection of hands-on technical labs demonstrating practical expertise in defensive infrastructure, network resilience, threat mitigation, container isolation, and enterprise identity architecture. 

This repository serves as a technical blueprint showcasing how I identify system weaknesses, remediate active misconfigurations, and build defensive automation scripts.

---

## 👨‍💻 Professional Profile

Dynamic, security-driven IT specialist focused on protecting and automating hybrid enterprise environments. 

* **Log Diagnostics & Monitoring:** Analyzing system activity to detect indicators of compromise (IoCs).
* **Infrastructure Engineering:** Architecting secure network routing and troubleshooting stack failures.
* **Defensive Scripting:** Developing operational workflows using Python and shell automation.
* **Virtualization & Workloads:** Implementing secure microservices and isolated application containers.
* **Access Control Architecture:** Deploying centralized identity management and domain policies.

