## 📂 Laboratory Roadmap

* **`01-os-hardening`** → Operating system defense, privilege auditing, and post-incident investigation.
* **`02-network-resilience`** → Interface rebuilding, routing recovery, and deep packet analytics.
* **`03-automation-defense`** → Developing defensive script logic and programmatic alerting systems.
* **`04-isolated-workloads`** → Container isolation strategies and strict perimeter segmentation.
* **`05-identity-governance`** → Domain architecture, centralized policy push, and cross-platform IAM.

