## 📌 Technical Deep Dives

### 🔍 Log Analysis & Threat Intelligence
* Designed logical parsing scripts to monitor authentication files for credential stuffing.
* Isolated adversarial source IPs to compile actionable JSON-formatted indicator feeds.
* Streamlined incident pipelines from raw file ingestion to actionable security notifications.

### 🌐 Perimeter Defense & Network Revival
* Reconstructed network profiles and routing rules on a non-functional asset to restore traffic.
* Resolved addressing conflicts and gateway configuration errors blocking external transit.
* Verified the integrity of the recovered connection by verifying three-way handshake parameters.

### 🐳 Containerized Environment Isolation
* Initialized restricted runtime environments to isolate application threats.
* Created multi-tier configurations that enforce strict boundary walls between apps and databases.
* Tested perimeter defenses to confirm zero unauthorized cross-network leakage.

### 🏢 Centralized Directory & Policy Enforcement
* Configured and deployed a functional Active Directory Domain Controller (`titan.local`).
* Built automation engines to handle batch employee provisioning securely.
* Established baseline configuration controls via Group Policy Objects (GPOs).
* Configured secure PAM subsystems on Linux endpoints for native AD credential validation.

